        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Headache for 4 days; gradual onset, bifrontal/temporal, dull with occasional sharp twinges, severity 5–7/10, worse in the evening and with screens; some relief with Panadol."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
